		"ja": [
			"注目のアニメ「コードギアス 反逆のルルーシュR2」より“ヴィンセント”が最速立体化！ ヒジ関節に新可動ギミックを導入し、1軸関節ながら非常に広い可動範囲を実現 ヒジ内部武装ギミック展開内蔵 大型ソードの可動＆合体ギミック再現"
		],
		"en": [
			"“Vincent” from the popular anime “Code Geass: Lelouch of the Rebellion R2” is the fastest to become three-dimensional! Introducing a new movable gimmick to the elbow joint, realizing a very wide range of motion even though it is a single axis joint. Built-in armed gimmick deployment inside the elbow. Reproducing the movable and combined gimmick of the large sword."
